                     <div class="card__content text-component">
                        <h3 class="card__header font-primary">Li Named 2026 McCausland Faculty Fellow</h3>
                        <p class="card__desc">Chosen as a McCausland Faculty Fellow, Wuchen Li develops mathematical foundations
                           for data science, machine learning and optimization, bridging theory and computation
                           to advance AI research.</p>
