                     <div class="card__content text-component">
                        <h3 class="card__header font-primary">USC’s Dr. Lili Ju honored as 2025 SIAM Fellow</h3>
                        <p class="card__desc">Dr. Lili Ju, professor of mathematics at USC, has been selected as a 2025 SIAM Fellow
